WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.534
You don't have to remember to look back. Your journal brings it to you.

2
00:00:05.834 --> 00:00:11.486
Every Monday, a card: last week, in one line, ready to watch.

3
00:00:12.786 --> 00:00:18.983
Some days, an old entry comes back, with the reason. A year ago today.

4
00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:25.834
Hold any day on the calendar, and see that date in every year you've told.

5
00:00:27.134 --> 00:00:32.495
No streaks. No catching up. Just what you said, coming back.

6
00:00:33.795 --> 00:00:36.065
It all shows up at the top of your journal.
